// MorphV2 first-difference locator: reads a vitest log and, for every failed comparison whose two
// sides vitest printed in full ("Expected: ..." / "Received: ..." lines, or a "- Expected" / "+ Received"
// diff block), prints where the two first differ, with 40 chars of context on each side. The assertion
// line itself is cut at truncateThreshold, so a one-word difference deep in a long string reads as two
// identical sides (P9b, output-directive-judge: three retries on "the file" / "a file").
// Inlined into the acceptances by decks/tools/build.py (from P9c on).
//   node firstdiff.mjs <vitest log>
